      "name": "Api",
      "kind": 1,
      "source": "Public Function RunProbe() As String\r\n    Dim ws As Excel.Worksheet, data() As Long, copied As Variant\r\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Worksheets(1)\r\n    ReDim data(1 To 2, 1 To 2)\r\n    data(1, 1) = 11\r\n    data(1, 2) = 12\r\n    data(2, 1) = 21\r\n    data(2, 2) = 22\r\n    ReDim Preserve data(1 To 2, 1 To 3)\r\n    data(1, 3) = 13\r\n    data(2, 3) = 23\r\n    ws.Range(\"A1:C2\").Value = data\r\n    copied = ws.Range(\"A1:C2\").Value\r\n    ws.Range(\"E1:G2\").Value = copied\r\n    ws.Range(\"I1\").Value2 = VarType(data)\r\n    RunProbe = \"ok\"\r\nEnd Function\r\n",
      "source_sha256": "sha256:45f68086d522c9a6a7c5323ade365f5d8d6cda84cc78e77415730c156bb79bb8",
